@ServiceShort_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Start the Api first. Replace the id with an id of a row in the table ExampleItem.

### ExampleGetRequest => OK, or 404 when the id does not exist
GET {{ServiceShort_HostAddress}}/servicelower/examples/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Health => OK
GET {{ServiceShort_HostAddress}}/health
